<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Infinite Gas (Multiplier stays active) 

This Macro is for use with AFK events in Forza Horizon 5. It provides Infinite gas and will keep the skill point multiplyer active.

Assign macro to desired key
Start afk event
Press assigned key
Then let it do its thing.




enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
KeyDown 49 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 49 1
KeyUp 26 1
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Forza Horizon 5</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>